WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.430
Sri Lanka, September 2022.

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.790
Headline inflation peaks at
70 per cent, the IMF says.

3
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.410
That year the economy
shrinks by 7.3 per cent,

4
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:14.590
and the country stops
paying its foreign debts.

5
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:21.990
In March 2023, the IMF approves a loan of
about 3 billion US dollars, with conditions.

6
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.830
Who writes those conditions?

7
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.030
Sri Lanka alone?

8
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.490
The banks it owes?

9
00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.680
And is there anywhere else to borrow?

10
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:33.290
In this mission, you'll untangle
aid, loans and debt relief.

11
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.250
Then you'll set the IMF
beside a newer lender:

12
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.070
the BRICS countries' New Development Bank.

13
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.490
Your mission: find out who sets
the terms of a rescue loan,

14
00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.830
and whether there is an alternative.
